### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 18 - ADMIN REST RESOURCES
###
### Tests for administrative resources including:
###   1. Behavioral Directives (self-evolve) CRUD, synthesis, reconciliation
###   2. System Prompt Registry CRUD, cache refreshing
###   3. Tiered Memory Admin: Core, Archival, Recall
###
### Prerequisites: Amsha Agent running in serve mode
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl    = http://localhost:8080
@validKey   = cWevfEoRvstUv0PqGpf02LzDY5kPNaz1y9GSl0LZOwU=
@ciKey      = JV/qXAikcUoSCCUsqYxLvNjxW/N3KROQtawg3VRFrJs=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW A: BEHAVIORAL DIRECTIVES (SELF-EVOLVE)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [ADMIN-DIR-1] List directives
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-DIR-2] Synthesize directives (unauthorized with CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives/synthesize
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-DIR-3] Synthesize directives (authorized with internal key)
# Expect 200 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives/synthesize
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-DIR-4] Reconcile directives (unauthorized with CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives/reconcile
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-DIR-5] Reconcile directives (authorized with internal key)
# Expect 200 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives/reconcile
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW B: SYSTEM PROMPT REGISTRY CRUD
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [ADMIN-PRM-1] List prompts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/prompts
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-PRM-2] Create prompt (unauthorized with CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/prompts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

{
    "roleId": "coordinator",
    "sectionKey": "test_section",
    "content": "This is a test prompt content.",
    "version": 1,
    "status": "ACTIVE",
    "rolloutPercentage": 100
}

###

### [ADMIN-PRM-3] Create prompt (authorized with internal key)
# Expect 201 Created with Location header
# @name createPrompt
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/prompts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "roleId": "coordinator",
    "sectionKey": "test_section",
    "content": "This is a test prompt content.",
    "version": 1,
    "status": "ACTIVE",
    "rolloutPercentage": 100
}

###

### [ADMIN-PRM-4] Get specific prompt
# Expect 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/prompts/test_section
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-PRM-5] Update prompt (unauthorized with CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/prompts/test_section
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

{
    "content": "Updated test prompt content."
}

###

### [ADMIN-PRM-6] Update prompt (authorized with internal key)
# Expect 200 OK
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/prompts/test_section
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "content": "Updated test prompt content."
}

###

### [ADMIN-PRM-7] Refresh cache
# Expect 200 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/prompts/refresh
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-PRM-8] Delete prompt (unauthorized with CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/prompts/test_section
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-PRM-9] Delete prompt (authorized with internal key)
# Expect 204 No Content
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/prompts/test_section
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###


