# --- Archival Memory Chunks ---

### [ADMIN-MEM-ARCH-1] Search archival memory chunks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/archival/search?query=test
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-MEM-ARCH-2] Evict low-confidence chunks (unauthorized with CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/archival/evict?threshold=0.5&minAgeDays=30
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-MEM-ARCH-3] Evict low-confidence chunks (authorized with internal key)
# Expect 200 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/archival/evict?threshold=0.5&minAgeDays=30
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

# --- Recall Memory Messages ---

### [ADMIN-MEM-RCL-1] Search recall memory messages
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/recall/search?query=test
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-MEM-RCL-2] Purge recall memory messages (unauthorized with CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/recall/purge?retentionDays=30
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-MEM-RCL-3] Purge recall memory messages (authorized with internal key)
# Expect 200 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/recall/purge?retentionDays=30
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###
